CHANGE ENTRY #8
Date: 2025-07-31
Topic: Fix — AR Reconciliation response structure + EDA modal transactional values
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

OVERVIEW:
  Two related bugs fixed:
  1. AR reconcile endpoint returned results nested under a "results" key,
     but the frontend read fields directly off arResult (e.g. arResult.matched).
     All AR result tabs showed 0 / empty because the data was never found.
  2. The EDA modal for transactional data showed generic master-data KPIs
     (matched/updated/inserted/missing/duplicates) instead of AR-specific
     financial values. The grand totals (Source Total, Target Total,
     Net Difference) and exception/duplicate counts were not shown at all.

FILES MODIFIED:

  backend/app.py  [FIXED]
  - BEFORE: ar_reconcile endpoint returned:
        { "source_mapping": ..., "target_mapping": ..., "results": { ...all fields... } }
    Frontend had to read arResult.results.matched_rows etc. — never worked.
  - AFTER: results are flattened to top level:
        {
          "summary":               { source_records, target_records, matched,
                                     amount_mismatch, only_in_source, only_in_target,
                                     tier2_matches, source_exceptions, target_exceptions,
                                     duplicate_keys_source, duplicate_keys_target,
                                     source_total, target_total, net_diff, tolerance },
          "matched":               [...matched_rows],
          "disputed":              [...mismatch_rows],
          "unmatched_source":      [...only_source_rows],
          "unmatched_target":      [...only_target_rows],
          "tier2_rows":            [...],
          "duplicate_source_rows": [...],
          "duplicate_target_rows": [...],
          "source_exceptions":     [...],
          "target_exceptions":     [...],
          "src_report":            [...column mapping],
          "tgt_report":            [...column mapping],
        }
  - IMPACT: All AR result tabs now correctly read their data.

  frontend/src/App.jsx  [FIXED]

  AR Results Panel (inline in Reconcile view):
  - BEFORE: tabs used wrong keys (src_report/tgt_report instead of
    dup_src/dup_tgt/exc_src/exc_tgt), Summary tab showed only row counts.
  - AFTER:
    - Summary tab now shows:
        Row 1 (3-column prominent): Grand Total Source | Grand Total Target |
                                    NET DIFFERENCE (Source - Target)
        Row 2 (count cards): Matched Txns, Amount Mismatch, Only in Source,
                              Only in Target, Tier-2, Src/Tgt Exceptions,
                              Dup Keys Src/Tgt, Tolerance
    - Tabs updated: Disputed/Amount Mismatch, Dup Keys Src, Dup Keys Tgt,
      Exceptions Src, Exceptions Tgt (replacing old src_report/tgt_report tabs)
    - fmtAmt() helper formats amounts as $X,XXX.XX
    - Net Difference card colour-coded: green=0, red=negative, amber=positive

  EDA Modal (Reconciliation EDA Report popup):
  - BEFORE: transactional data showed master-data KPIs (Total/Matched/Updated/
    Inserted/Missing/Duplicate/Quality) and master-data summary cards.
    Grand totals and financial values were never shown.
  - AFTER (isAR path = dataType==='transactional' && arResult?.summary):
    - KPI strip: 11 AR-specific cells (Source Records, Target Records,
      Matched Txns, Amount Mismatch, Only in Source/Target, Tier-2,
      Src/Tgt Exceptions, Dup Keys Src/Tgt)
    - AR Financial Summary section:
        Prominent 3-column row: Grand Total Source | Grand Total Target |
                                 NET DIFFERENCE (Source - Target)
        Count cards below: Source/Target Exceptions, Dup Keys, Matched,
                           Amount Mismatch, Unmatched Src/Tgt, Tier-2, Tolerance
    - Transaction Breakdown pie chart: Matched / Amount Mismatch /
      Only in Source / Only in Target / Tier-2 / Exceptions
    - fmtAmt() helper added for consistent $X,XXX.XX formatting
  - Master-data path: completely unchanged.

